  "90 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 26 min of vigorous work a week. Some muscle soreness is expected; joint pain is not. Still sore after 48 hours? Repeat sessions before moving up.": "Dakika 90 za Zone 2 iliyoratibiwa na takriban dakika 26 za kazi kubwa kwa wiki. Uchungu fulani wa misuli unatarajiwa; maumivu ya pamoja sio. Bado unaumwa baada ya masaa 48? Rudia vipindi kabla ya kusonga juu.",
