  "Activity groups This week, History and Progress into one navigation item with three tabs.": "Vikundi vya shughuli Wiki hii, Historia na Maendeleo katika kipengee kimoja cha kusogeza chenye vichupo vitatu.",
  "Activity keeps all four tabs on one line and stacks the three weekly progress charts.": "Shughuli huweka vichupo vyote vinne kwenye mstari mmoja na kuweka chati tatu za maendeleo za kila wiki.",
