  "Add or edit your equipment during setup or in Settings under Your equipment. These home exercises stand in for Bryan's gym exercises.": "Ongeza au uhariri kifaa chako wakati wa kusanidi au katika Mipangilio chini ya kifaa chako. Mazoezi haya ya nyumbani yanatumika kwa mazoezi ya gym ya Bryan.",
  "Add set": "Ongeza seti",
  "Add set is a labelled button at the end of the last set row. Set cards stay narrow and extra sets scroll inside their box.": "Ongeza seti ni kitufe chenye lebo mwishoni mwa safu mlalo iliyowekwa mwisho. Kadi zilizowekwa hukaa finyu na seti za ziada zitembeze ndani ya kisanduku chao.",
  "Add set stays at the end of the last set row, and the timer and remove buttons line up across every row.": "Ongeza masalio ya seti mwishoni mwa safu mlalo iliyowekwa mwisho, na kipima saa na vitufe kwenye mstari kwenye kila safu.",
  "Add weight only when you hit the top of the rep range on every set with clean form, two sessions in a row: about +{kg:1-2} per dumbbell for upper body, +{kg:2-4} for legs. Bryan’s protocol stresses progressive overload: increase the load gradually.": "Ongeza uzito unapofika tu kilele cha safu ya uwakilishi kwenye kila seti iliyo na umbo safi, vipindi viwili mfululizo: kuhusu +{kg:1-2} kwa kila dumbbell kwa sehemu ya juu ya mwili, +{kg:2-4} kwa miguu. Itifaki ya Bryan inasisitiza upakiaji unaoendelea: ongeza mzigo polepole.",
  "Add weight only when you hit the top of the rep range on every set with clean form, two sessions in a row: about +0.5–1 kg per dumbbell for upper body, +1–2.5 kg for legs. Bryan’s protocol stresses progressive overload: increase the load gradually.": "Ongeza uzito tu unapogonga sehemu ya juu ya safu kwenye kila seti iliyo na umbo safi, vipindi viwili mfululizo: takriban +0.5-1 kg kwa dumbbell kwa sehemu ya juu ya mwili, +1-2.5 kg kwa miguu. Itifaki ya Bryan inasisitiza upakiaji unaoendelea: ongeza mzigo polepole.",
  "Add your equipment names and product links, or skip this step and do it later in Settings. The animations show how the plan uses each accessory.": "Ongeza majina ya kifaa chako na viungo vya bidhaa, au ruka hatua hii na uifanye baadaye katika Mipangilio. Uhuishaji unaonyesha jinsi mpango unavyotumia kila nyongeza.",
  "Add your own equipment below.": "Ongeza kifaa chako mwenyewe hapa chini.",
