  "Add-on repeats appear on their exact cycle days again; every 3 days no longer shows the add-on daily.": "Marudio ya nyongeza yanaonekana kwenye siku zao za mzunguko tena; kila siku 3 haionyeshi tena programu jalizi ya kila siku.",
  "Add-on repeats now count from the last completed or skipped day and stay available until done, instead of appearing only on exact cycle days.": "Marudio ya programu jalizi sasa yanahesabiwa kuanzia siku ya mwisho iliyokamilishwa au iliyorukwa na iendelee kupatikana hadi ikamilike, badala ya kuonekana katika siku kamili za mzunguko pekee.",
