  "An in-workout audio coach for interval training: spoken cues for work intervals, recovery blocks, heart-rate target reminders, 30-second warnings, and a voice toggle in the interval timer and Settings.": "Kocha ya sauti ya ndani ya mazoezi ya mafunzo ya muda: vidokezo vinavyotamkwa kwa muda wa kazi, vizuizi vya uokoaji, vikumbusho lengwa vya mapigo ya moyo, maonyo ya sekunde 30, na kugeuza sauti kwa kipima muda na Mipangilio.",
  "Anchor a band at chest height behind you (door hinge side) or wrap it around your upper back.": "Weka mkanda kwa urefu wa kifua nyuma yako (upande wa bawaba ya mlango) au uifunge kwenye mgongo wako wa juu.",
