  "Animation styles (a test): nine ways to draw the exercise animation, for now only on Zone 2 (\"Easy step-ups or marching\"); every other exercise keeps the mannequin. Mannequin, Athlete (semi-realistic), Anime (cel-shaded), Low poly, Cartoon (ink outlines) and Voxel are three.js scenes; Pictogram (SVG), Ink brush (2D canvas) and ASCII (text) are drawn without three.js. All of them play the same movement.": "Mitindo ya uhuishaji (jaribio): njia tisa za kuchora uhuishaji wa zoezi, kwa sasa tu kwenye Kanda ya 2 (\"Hatua rahisi au kuandamana\"); kila mazoezi mengine huweka mannequin. Mannequin, Mwanaspoti (nusu uhalisia), Anime (cel-shaded), Low poly, Cartoon (wino muhtasari) na Voxel ni scenes three.js; Pictogram (SVG), Brashi ya Wino (2D canvas) na ASCII (maandishi) yamechorwa bila three.js. Wote wanacheza harakati sawa.",
