  "At easier levels, move slowly until you learn the movement.": "Katika viwango rahisi, songa polepole hadi ujifunze harakati.",
  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "Angalau dakika 120 za Eneo la 2 lililopangwa na kama dakika 51 za Cardio ngumu kwa wiki; ilidhibiti vizuizi vikali Jumanne, Alhamisi na Jumamosi.",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, weka kasi haraka na chini ya juhudi zote. At Active, fanya kazi kwa bidii. At Well trained, tumia juhudi zote.",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above, shikilia dumbbell kwa kila mkono, au funga mkanda kiunoni mwako na nanga yake mbele yako. Bendi inapaswa kukuvuta mbele, kama sled.",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning, sukuma nyuma kwa mikono yako. At higher levels, jirudishe nyuma kwa misuli ya paja.",
  "At the end of your last interval, note your peak heart rate. Walk gently for 60 seconds and note your heart rate again. Enter the drop (peak minus 60s reading).": "Mwishoni mwa muda wako wa mwisho, kumbuka kiwango cha juu cha moyo wako. Tembea kwa upole kwa sekunde 60 na uangalie mapigo ya moyo wako tena. Ingiza kushuka (kilele ukiondoa kusoma kwa 60s).",
