  "Athlete is now the default style and comes first; Mannequin is number 2. If you already picked a style, you keep it. Every exercise without styles still shows the mannequin.": "Mwanaspoti sasa ndiye mtindo chaguo-msingi na huja kwanza; Mannequin ni namba 2. Ikiwa tayari umechukua mtindo, unaiweka. Kila zoezi bila mitindo bado linaonyesha mannequin.",
  "Athlete wears a cobalt blue shirt, coral shorts and redesigned white trainers with blue panels and laces.": "Mwanariadha amevaa shati ya bluu ya cobalt, kaptula za matumbawe na wakufunzi wa rangi nyeupe na paneli za bluu na laces.",
