  "Balance and the stability exercises from his official protocol run through the week. Every session ends with flexibility work.": "Mizani na mazoezi ya uthabiti kutoka kwa itifaki yake rasmi huendeshwa kwa wiki. Kila kipindi huisha na kazi ya kubadilika.",
  "balance drill": "kuchimba usawa",
  "Balance is one of Bryan’s five exercise pillars (his May 2026 video). His free biological-age check uses a one-leg stand with eyes closed. Being able to stand on one leg for 10 s is linked with lower all-cause mortality.": "Mizani ni mojawapo ya nguzo tano za mazoezi ya Bryan (video yake ya Mei 2026). Uchunguzi wake wa bure wa umri wa kibaolojia hutumia kisimamo cha mguu mmoja na macho yaliyofungwa. Kuweza kusimama kwa mguu mmoja kwa sekunde 10 kunahusishwa na vifo vya chini vya sababu zote.",
  "Balance is one of Bryan's five exercise pillars. Balance decline closely mirrors cerebellar, vestibular and neurological brain aging.": "Mizani ni mojawapo ya nguzo tano za mazoezi za Bryan. Kupungua kwa usawa huakisi serebela, vestibuli na kuzeeka kwa ubongo wa neva.",
  "Balance or stability on 5 days, stretching every day, posture every day with his two physical-therapist exercises to fatigue twice a week.": "Mizani au utulivu kwa siku 5, kukaza mwendo kila siku, mkao kila siku na mazoezi yake mawili ya kimwili mtaalamu wa uchovu mara mbili kwa wiki.",
