  "Blueprint's title block names the exercise, and it dimensions steps and boxes only when there is one. Doodle has jokes for each kind of exercise and tallies the reps as they're counted; its speech bubble no longer covers the figure.": "Kizuizi cha kichwa cha Blueprint kinataja zoezi hilo, na hupima hatua na visanduku wakati tu kuna moja. Doodle ina vicheshi kwa kila aina ya mazoezi na huhesabu wawakilishi kadri wanavyohesabiwa; kiputo chake cha usemi hakifunika tena sura.",
