  "Bones remodel when subjected to high-rate mechanical loads. Heel drops, stomps, and hops generate 3–4× bodyweight ground-reaction forces.": "Mifupa hurekebisha wakati inakabiliwa na mizigo ya juu ya mitambo. Matone ya kisigino, kukanyaga, na humle huzalisha nguvu za mwitikio wa ardhini wa 3–4×.",
