  "Both speaking paces share cached audio, and repeated interval cues reuse the same clips.": "Hatua zote mbili za kuzungumza hushiriki sauti iliyohifadhiwa, na viashiria vya muda vinavyorudiwa hutumia tena klipu zilezile.",
