  "Bryan adds a weighted vest during Zone 2 walks and hikes to increase axial bone loading safely.": "Bryan anaongeza fulana yenye uzani wakati wa matembezi ya Zone 2 na kupanda ili kuongeza upakiaji wa mfupa wa axial kwa usalama.",
  "Bryan calls the phone the worst trigger for bad posture. Hold it at eye level and put the top of your monitor at eye level too.": "Bryan anaita simu kichochezi kibaya zaidi cha mkao mbaya. Shikilia kwa usawa wa macho na uweke sehemu ya juu ya kichungi chako kwenye usawa wa macho pia.",
  "Bryan calls this technical and was taught it for his own diagnosed condition. Stay gentle, and stop if you get dizziness, tingling or a headache.": "Bryan anaita hii ya kiufundi na alifundishwa kwa hali yake mwenyewe iliyotambuliwa. Kaa kwa upole, na uache ikiwa unapata kizunguzungu, kuchochea au maumivu ya kichwa.",
  "Bryan demo with timestamp": "Onyesho la Bryan lililo na muhuri wa muda",
  "Bryan demonstrates it at {time} ({clock})": "Bryan anaionyesha katika {time} ({clock})",
  "Bryan did 1 × 10 in 2023. His 2025 Galpin session includes Nordic curls in the strength block. They protect against hamstring strains.": "Bryan alifanya 1 × 10 mwaka wa 2023. Kipindi chake cha 2025 Galpin kinajumuisha curls za Nordic katika kuzuia nguvu. Wanalinda dhidi ya matatizo ya hamstring.",
  "Bryan does “butterfly pulls” with a resistance band, 1 × 15. Most write-ups describe it as a band chest fly; watch his clip to copy his exact version.": "Bryan anafanya \"butterfly pulls\" na bendi ya upinzani, 1 × 15. Maandishi mengi yanaelezea kuwa bendi ya kifua ya kuruka; tazama clip yake ili kunakili toleo lake halisi.",
  "Bryan does 3 × 10 per leg, learned from Ben Patrick, the Knees-Over-Toes coach working with him on his 2026 dunk project. It builds the inner quad (VMO) and knee resilience.": "Bryan hufanya 3 × 10 kwa kila mguu, alijifunza kutoka kwa Ben Patrick, kocha wa Knees-Over-Toes anayefanya kazi naye kwenye mradi wake wa 2026 wa dunk. Inajenga quad ya ndani (VMO) na ustahimilivu wa magoti.",
  "Bryan does both grips": "Bryan anashika zote mbili",
  "Bryan does both. His 2025 Galpin session includes them in the strength block at 2 × 5–8. His official beginner list uses assisted pull-ups.": "Bryan anafanya yote mawili. Kikao chake cha 2025 cha Galpin kinawajumuisha kwenye kizuizi cha nguvu kwa 2 × 5-8. Orodha yake rasmi ya wanaoanza hutumia usaidizi wa kuvuta-ups.",
  "Bryan does the Pallof press in his 2025 session with Dr. Andy Galpin. It trains the trunk to resist twisting.": "Bryan anafanya magazeti ya Pallof katika kipindi chake cha 2025 na Dk. Andy Galpin. Inafundisha shina kupinga kupotosha.",
  "Bryan does tibialis raises (1 × 25, single-leg in his list). His 2026 dunk notes mention limited ankle dorsiflexion. This exercise works on that movement.": "Bryan anainua tibialis (1 × 25, mguu mmoja katika orodha yake). Vidokezo vyake vya 2026 vinataja ulegevu mdogo wa kifundo cha mguu. Zoezi hili linafanya kazi kwenye harakati hiyo.",
  "Bryan has been training to dunk at 49 since July 2026, using heavy lifts with jumps between sets. He says he needs more fast-twitch fibres and faster force development, and warns about Achilles risk from landing forces. Learn to land before working on height.": "Bryan amekuwa akifanya mazoezi ya kuzama akiwa na umri wa miaka 49 tangu Julai 2026, akitumia lifti nzito na kuruka kati ya seti. Anasema anahitaji nyuzi zinazobadilika haraka na ukuzaji wa nguvu haraka, na anaonya kuhusu hatari ya Achilles kutoka kwa nguvu za kutua. Jifunze kutua kabla ya kufanya kazi kwa urefu.",
