  "Bryan Johnson’s Workout Protocol": "Itifaki ya Workout ya Bryan Johnson",
  "Bryan Johnson's zero-blood, at-home physical testing battery. Track your functional biomarkers against elite 18-year-old and longevity longevity percentiles.": "Betri ya sifuri ya damu ya Bryan Johnson, inayopima mwili nyumbani. Fuatilia viashirio vyako vinavyofanya kazi dhidi ya wasomi wa umri wa miaka 18 na asilimia ya maisha marefu.",
  "Bryan measures grip strength as a primary longevity biomarker (scoring ~60 kg, top 5% of all ages). Hanging decompresses the spine and builds forearm grip endurance.": "Bryan hupima nguvu ya mshiko kama alama ya msingi ya maisha marefu (akifunga ~ kilo 60, 5% ya juu ya umri wote). Kunyongwa kunapunguza uti wa mgongo na kujenga ustahimilivu wa kushika mkono.",
  "Bryan on X: 10 squats every 45 minutes of sitting": "Bryan kwenye X: anachuchumaa mara 10 kila dakika 45 za kukaa",
  "Bryan on X: a jump in between sets": "Bryan kwenye X: kuruka kati ya seti",
  "Bryan on X: how he does 4×4 HIIT": "Bryan kwenye X: anavyofanya 4×4 HIIT",
  "Bryan on X: the two posture exercises, with clips": "Bryan kwenye X: mazoezi mawili ya mkao, na klipu",
  "Bryan on X: training to dunk, heavy pull": "Bryan juu ya X: mafunzo ya dunk, kuvuta nzito",
  "Bryan opens his workouts with a backward sled drag (about 2 min in his 2023 routine, still first in his 2025 warm-up with Dr. Andy Galpin). It works the knees and quads using the Knees-Over-Toes approach.": "Bryan anafungua mazoezi yake kwa kuburuta kwa nyuma (kama dakika 2 katika utaratibu wake wa 2023, bado ni wa kwanza katika mazoezi yake ya 2025 ya kujiandaa na Dk. Andy Galpin). Inafanya kazi kwa magoti na quads kwa kutumia mbinu ya Knees-Over-Toes.",
  "Bryan puts injury prevention first. If a joint hurts, open the exercise and switch to its easier version.": "Bryan anatanguliza kuzuia majeraha. Ikiwa kiungo kinaumiza, fungua zoezi na ubadilishe kwa toleo lake rahisi.",
  "Bryan shared this tip in April 2026 for days spent sitting. In the study he cited, squat breaks improved blood sugar more than one 30-minute walk. He stressed taking breaks from sitting.": "Bryan alishiriki kidokezo hiki mnamo Aprili 2026 kwa siku alizotumia kukaa. Katika utafiti alioutaja, mapumziko ya squat yaliboresha sukari ya damu zaidi ya dakika 30 ya kutembea. Alisisitiza kuchukua mapumziko kutoka kwa kukaa.",
  "Bryan spends weekends hiking, biking, climbing or playing pickleball at an easy pace. Your indoor session combines controlled vigorous cardio at your level, a long Zone 2 block and 20 min of stretching. This is the second posture strength day.": "Bryan hutumia wikendi kwa kupanda baiskeli, kupanda baiskeli au kucheza mpira wa kachumbari kwa mwendo rahisi. Kikao chako cha ndani huchanganya Cardio yenye nguvu inayodhibitiwa katika kiwango chako, kizuizi kirefu cha Zone 2 na dakika 20 za kunyoosha. Hii ni siku ya pili ya nguvu ya mkao.",
  "Bryan targets at least 75 min of high-intensity cardio a week, with only about 10 min near maximum effort. This home block supplies controlled vigorous minutes alongside his Tuesday bursts and Thursday 4×4; its duration is set for this home plan and differs from the sessions in his sample week.": "Bryan analenga angalau dakika 75 za Cardio ya juu kwa wiki, na takriban dakika 10 tu karibu na bidii ya juu. Vifaa hivi vya kuzuia nyumbani vilidhibiti dakika kali pamoja na kupasuka kwake Jumanne na Alhamisi 4×4; muda wake umewekwa kwa mpango huu wa nyumbani na hutofautiana na vipindi katika sampuli yake ya wiki.",
  "Bryan tests ~60 kg (top 5% across all ages). Handgrip strength is a primary biological age biomarker in clinical longevity literature.": "Bryan hupima ~ kilo 60 (asilimia 5 ya juu katika umri wote). Nguvu ya kushika mkono ni alama ya msingi ya umri wa kibaolojia katika fasihi ya maisha marefu ya kliniki.",
  "Bryan tests at ~64 ml/kg/min (top 1% 18yo). Cardiovascular fitness is the single strongest statistical predictor of longevity.": "Vipimo vya Bryan kwa ~ 64 ml/kg/min (kiwango cha juu cha 1% miaka 18). Siha ya moyo na mishipa ndiyo kitabiri chenye nguvu zaidi cha takwimu cha maisha marefu.",
  "Bryan trains obliques for 1 × 25: on the hyperextension bench in 2023, as oblique side bends in his 2025 conditioning block.": "Bryan hufunza oblique kwa 1 × 25: kwenye benchi ya hyperextension mnamo 2023, huku upande wa oblique ukiinama kwenye kizuizi chake cha 2025.",
  "Bryan with Dr. Andy Galpin: Exercise Scientist Dismantles My Longevity Workout": "Bryan akiwa na Dk. Andy Galpin: Mwanasayansi wa Mazoezi Anaondoa Mazoezi Yangu ya Muda Mrefu",
