  "Choose a level below when you need an easier or harder workout. Past logs keep their original level.": "Chagua kiwango hapa chini unapohitaji mazoezi rahisi au magumu zaidi. Kumbukumbu zilizopita huweka kiwango chao cha asili.",
  "Choose a reason so you can see it later in History. You can return to your usual schedule or swap sessions when you're ready.": "Chagua sababu ili uweze kuiona baadaye katika Historia. Unaweza kurudi kwenye ratiba yako ya kawaida au ubadilishane vipindi ukiwa tayari.",
  "Choose a theme from these Today screenshots. Each shows a different exercise and animation style; you can choose your animation style below.": "Chagua mandhari kutoka kwa picha hizi za skrini za Leo. Kila moja inaonyesha mazoezi tofauti na mtindo wa uhuishaji; unaweza kuchagua mtindo wako wa uhuishaji hapa chini.",
  "Choose a theme to try its layout, fonts and colours. The screenshots show different animation styles; choose yours later in Settings. You can change either choice any time.": "Chagua mandhari ili ujaribu mpangilio, fonti na rangi zake. Picha za skrini zinaonyesha mitindo tofauti ya uhuishaji; chagua yako baadaye katika Mipangilio. Unaweza kubadilisha chaguo lolote wakati wowote.",
  "Choose an easier or harder level. Past logs keep the level they were done at.": "Chagua kiwango rahisi au ngumu zaidi. Kumbukumbu zilizopita huweka kiwango walichofanya.",
  "Choose any extra blocks you want after your workout. You can log them like the main session and change your choices in Settings.": "Chagua vizuizi vyovyote vya ziada unavyotaka baada ya mazoezi yako. Unaweza kuziweka kama kipindi kikuu na ubadilishe chaguo zako katika Mipangilio.",
  "Choose for a work interval": "Chagua kwa muda wa kazi",
  "Choose from the indoor interval moves. Each has a quieter version.": "Chagua kutoka kwa hatua za muda wa ndani. Kila moja ina toleo tulivu.",
  "Choose movements from this list for your intervals, then record them in the interval block.": "Chagua miondoko kutoka kwenye orodha hii kwa vipindi vyako, kisha uzirekodi kwenye kizuizi cha muda.",
  "Choose the language for the app, the exercise instructions and the coach. You can change it later in Settings.": "Chagua lugha ya programu, maagizo ya mazoezi na kocha. Unaweza kuibadilisha baadaye katika Mipangilio.",
  "Choose the version prescribed in your workout": "Chagua toleo lililowekwa kwenye mazoezi yako",
