  "Guided exercise doses, set announcements, form cues during rest and spoken interval, hold and cardio timers.": "Vipimo vya mazoezi ya kuongozwa, matangazo yaliyowekwa, fomu za ishara wakati wa kupumzika na muda wa kuzungumza, kushikilia na vipima muda vya moyo.",
  "Guided intervals show every round in order beneath the demonstration, including recovery breaks.": "Vipindi vinavyoongozwa huonyesha kila raundi kwa mpangilio chini ya onyesho, ikijumuisha mapumziko.",
  "Guided navigation leaves completion unchanged; the progress bar reflects completed steps only.": "Urambazaji unaoongozwa huacha kukamilika bila kubadilika; upau wa maendeleo unaonyesha hatua zilizokamilishwa pekee.",
  "Guided timed exercises now open with the timer already running in the right panel; Pause, Next and Stop sit beside it, and the old timer button is only a restart.": "Mazoezi yaliyoratibiwa kwa wakati sasa yanafunguliwa huku kipima muda kikiwa tayari kinatumika kwenye paneli sahihi; Sitisha, Ifuatayo na Acha keti kando yake, na kitufe cha zamani cha kipima saa ni kuwasha tena.",
  "Guided timed exercises show a compact Start timer card instead of starting on their own. Only one timer sits in the right panel, and stopping or logging it brings the Start card back for the next set.": "Mazoezi yaliyoratibiwa kwa wakati yanaonyesha kadi ya kipima saa cha Kuanza badala ya kuanza yenyewe. Kipima saa kimoja pekee kinakaa kwenye kidirisha cha kulia, na kukisimamisha au kukiweka hurejesha Kadi ya Kuanza kwa seti inayofuata.",
  "Guided timers run in the same row as the value, in place of the timer button, and no longer push the form down.": "Vipima muda vinavyoongozwa huendeshwa katika safu mlalo sawa na thamani, badala ya kitufe cha kipima muda, na havisukumi tena fomu chini.",
  "Guided timers start from the timer button beside each editable value instead of a separate Start card. They still never start by themselves.": "Vipima muda vinavyoongozwa huanza kutoka kwa kitufe cha kipima muda kando ya kila thamani inayoweza kuhaririwa badala ya kadi tofauti ya Kuanza. Bado hawaanzi peke yao.",
