  "Keep a chair beside you for balance at first; add dumbbells later. The animation shows the hands-free version.": "Weka kiti kando yako kwa usawa mwanzoni; ongeza dumbbells baadaye. Uhuishaji unaonyesha toleo lisilo na mikono.",
  "Keep a hard, controlled pace. Change the indoor move every minute.": "Weka kasi ngumu, iliyodhibitiwa. Badilisha hoja ya ndani kila dakika.",
  "Keep a wall within reach at first; the animation shows the hands-free version.": "Weka ukuta ndani ya kufikia mara ya kwanza; uhuishaji unaonyesha toleo lisilo na mikono.",
  "Keep adding weight using the rules below. After illness, injury or a long break, step down a level for a while.": "Endelea kuongeza uzito kwa kutumia sheria hapa chini. Baada ya ugonjwa, kuumia au mapumziko marefu, shuka ngazi kwa muda.",
  "Keep both heels down and lift both sets of toes.": "Weka visigino vyote chini na kuinua seti zote mbili za vidole.",
  "Keep each bounce quick, quiet and springy. Build height later.": "Weka kila bounce haraka, utulivu na chemchemi. Jenga urefu baadaye.",
  "Keep going: {count} more {sessions}{weeks} to the checkpoint. Tick the checks when they are true.": "Endelea: {count} zaidi {sessions}{weeks} hadi kituo cha ukaguzi. Weka alama kwenye hundi zinapokuwa kweli.",
  "Keep going: 18 more sessions (about 3 weeks) to the checkpoint. Tick the checks when they are true.": "Endelea: Vipindi 18 zaidi (kama wiki 3) hadi kituo cha ukaguzi. Weka alama kwenye hundi zinapokuwa kweli.",
  "Keep knees unlocked: soft knees allow the bone to absorb osteogenic impact without straining the joint cartilage.": "Weka magoti kufunguliwa: magoti laini huruhusu mfupa kunyonya athari ya osteogenic bila kuimarisha cartilage ya pamoja.",
  "Keep the back leg long to stretch the hip flexor.": "Weka mguu wa nyuma kwa muda mrefu ili kunyoosha flexor ya hip.",
  "Keep the effort controlled. Save near-max efforts for the short bursts and the ends of the 4×4 rounds.": "Weka juhudi kudhibitiwa. Okoa juhudi za karibu zaidi kwa milipuko mifupi na miisho ya raundi 4×4.",
  "Keep the effort gentle and focus on form before adding weight. Chin tucks and the doorway stretch are standard exercises outside Bryan's routine.": "Weka juhudi kwa upole na uzingatia fomu kabla ya kuongeza uzito. Kuweka kidevu na kunyoosha mlango ni mazoezi ya kawaida nje ya utaratibu wa Bryan.",
  "Keep the knees bent so they travel forward over the toes, and push the floor away in front of you.": "Weka magoti yaliyoinama ili wasafiri mbele juu ya vidole vya miguu, na kusukuma sakafu mbele yako.",
  "Keep the other leg long and both feet on the floor.": "Weka mguu mwingine mrefu na miguu yote miwili kwenye sakafu.",
  "Keep the route clear and turn before reaching the wall.": "Weka njia wazi na ugeuke kabla ya kufikia ukuta.",
  "Keep the selected exercise animation visible when switching between Course and other themes.": "Weka uhuishaji wa mazoezi uliochaguliwa uonekane wakati wa kubadilisha kati ya Kozi na mada zingine.",
  "Keep this movement selected": "Chagua harakati hii",
  "Keep your body straight from knees to head and squeeze your glutes.": "Weka mwili wako moja kwa moja kutoka kwa magoti hadi kichwa na itapunguza glute zako.",
  "Keep your landings light and quiet. Follow the pace prescribed for this step.": "Weka kutua kwako kuwa nyepesi na tulivu. Fuata kasi iliyowekwa kwa hatua hii.",
  "Keep your neck long and look forward and down.": "Weka shingo yako kwa muda mrefu na uangalie mbele na chini.",
  "Keep your ribs down without arching your lower back. Stop if you feel pinching in the shoulder.": "Weka mbavu zako chini bila kukunja mgongo wako wa chini. Acha ikiwa unahisi kushinikiza kwenye bega.",
  "Keep your steps quiet and adjust your pace to the prescribed effort.": "Weka hatua zako kimya na urekebishe mwendo wako kwa juhudi zilizoagizwa.",
  "Keep your toes lightly resting on the floor or a step to support 20–30% of your body weight.": "Weka vidole vyako vimepumzika kidogo kwenye sakafu au hatua ili kuhimili 20-30% ya uzito wa mwili wako.",
  "Keep your torso still.": "Weka kiwiliwili chako tuli.",
  "Keep your whole foot on the step and follow today's pace and heart-rate target.": "Weka mguu wako wote kwenye hatua na ufuate kasi ya leo na lengo la mapigo ya moyo.",
  "Kept the palm on the forehead during neck resistance and widened views that clipped hands or feet.": "Aliweka kiganja kwenye paji la uso wakati wa upinzani wa shingo na maoni yaliyopanuliwa ambayo yalipunguza mikono au miguu.",
