  "Only the default Heart voice is prepared locally. Every other voice shows Download locally in Voice coach and is copied to your computer only when you ask for it.": "Sauti chaguomsingi pekee ya Moyo ndiyo inayotayarishwa ndani ya nchi. Kila sauti nyingine inaonyesha Pakua ndani ya nchi katika Voice coach na inanakiliwa kwenye kompyuta yako tu unapoiomba.",
