  "Place a hand on your forehead and resist gentle backward pressure without moving your head.": "Weka mkono kwenye paji la uso wako na kupinga shinikizo la nyuma la upole bila kusonga kichwa chako.",
  "place your hands on the mat. Use it for planks, floor work and stretches too.": "weka mikono yako kwenye mkeka. Itumie kwa mbao, kazi ya sakafu na kunyoosha pia.",
  "Place your whole foot on the step. Push through that leg until you stand tall.": "Weka mguu wako wote kwenye hatua. Sukuma kwenye mguu huo hadi usimame mrefu.",
  "Plan": "Mpango",
  "Plan and track six home workouts a week based on Bryan Johnson's public exercise protocol. You'll do strength training three days a week, plus short intervals, the Norwegian 4×4, Zone 2, balance and mobility. The workouts use bodyweight, adjustable dumbbells, a pull-up bar and bands.": "Panga na ufuatilie mazoezi sita ya nyumbani kwa wiki kulingana na itifaki ya mazoezi ya umma ya Bryan Johnson. Utafanya mazoezi ya nguvu siku tatu kwa wiki, pamoja na vipindi vifupi, 4×4 ya Norwe, Eneo la 2, usawa na uhamaji. Mazoezi hutumia uzito wa mwili, dumbbells zinazoweza kubadilishwa, upau wa kuvuta juu na bendi.",
  "Plan change history now lives in Settings instead of the Plan page.": "Historia ya mabadiliko ya mpango sasa inaishi katika Mipangilio badala ya ukurasa wa Mpango.",
  "Plan change:": "Mabadiliko ya mpango:",
  "Plan change: A new, gentler set of workouts for New to training: supported or smaller-range moves, 1 to 2 sets, no jumps, swings or Nordics, shorter intervals and Zone 2.": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Seti mpya na nyepesi ya mazoezi ya Mpya kwa mafunzo: hatua zinazotumika au za masafa madogo, seti 1 hadi 2, hakuna kuruka, bembea au Nordics, vipindi vifupi na Zone 2.",
  "Plan change: Added two optional Blueprint micro-routine add-ons in Settings: Bone density protocol (heel drops & stomp drills, pogo hops, and landing drills from Bryan's bone health guide) and Dead hang & grip (passive and active bar hangs and farmer's holds for spinal decompression and grip longevity).": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Imeongeza nyongeza mbili za hiari za Blueprint katika Mipangilio: Itifaki ya msongamano wa mifupa (matone ya kisigino & drill za kukanyaga, hops za pogo, na mazoezi ya kutua kutoka kwa mwongozo wa afya wa mfupa wa Bryan) na Dead hang & grip (upau unaofanya kazi huning'inia na vishikio vya mkulima kwa kupunguka kwa uti wa mgongo na kushikilia maisha marefu).",
  "Plan change: Changing your training level in Settings now switches you to that level's workouts: weights rescale and your phase restarts from the level's starting point.": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Kubadilisha kiwango chako cha mafunzo katika Mipangilio sasa hukubadilisha hadi mazoezi ya kiwango hicho: kupunguza uzani na awamu yako inaanza tena kutoka mahali pa kuanzia ngazi.",
  "Plan change: Clarified the setup notes for ATG split squats, single-leg toe touches, band pull-aparts, standing external rotation, side planks and side-to-side leg swings.": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Ilifafanua maelezo ya usanidi wa kuchuchumaa kwa mgawanyiko wa ATG, miguso ya mguu mmoja, vuta-tengano za bendi, mzunguko wa nje uliosimama, mbao za kando na bembea za mguu kutoka upande hadi upande.",
  "Plan change: Combined warm-ups and exercise variations now appear as separate movements. Guided pairs alternate one set at a time, keeping the existing doses.": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Viwasha-joto na tofauti za mazoezi sasa zinaonekana kama mienendo tofauti. Jozi zinazoongozwa hubadilisha seti moja kwa wakati, kuweka dozi zilizopo.",
  "Plan change: Phases (Re-entry, Build, Blueprint), their automatic advance after 12 and 24 sessions, the phase lock and the starting-phase setting.": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Awamu (Ingiza tena, Jenga, Mchoro), mapema yao ya kiotomatiki baada ya vipindi 12 na 24, kufuli ya awamu na mpangilio wa awamu ya kuanzia.",
  "Plan change: Scheduled Zone 2 and controlled vigorous cardio scale by level toward Bryan’s weekly targets of 150 minutes of Zone 2 and 75 minutes of hard cardio.": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Iliyoratibiwa ya Eneo la 2 na kudhibiti mizani kali ya moyo kwa kiwango kuelekea malengo ya kila wiki ya Bryan ya dakika 150 za Zone 2 na dakika 75 za Cardio ngumu.",
  "Plan change: Setup no longer asks you to pick a starting phase: your training level decides it. \"Well trained\" now starts in Blueprint (was Build).": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Mipangilio haikuombi tena kuchagua awamu ya kuanzia: kiwango chako cha mafunzo ndicho kinachoamua. \"Umefunzwa vizuri\" sasa inaanza katika Blueprint (ilikuwa Jenga).",
  "Plan change: Side-to-side leg swings say \"Stand tall with one hand on the wall\" (the animation stands square, not side-on).": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Miguu ya upande hadi upande husema \"Simama kwa urefu na mkono mmoja ukutani\" (uhuishaji unasimama mraba, sio ubavu).",
  "Plan change: Single-leg balance and the forehead-resistance hold no longer state a fixed time or count that differs from your level; their animation cues now point to the time or holds your level prescribes.": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Mizani ya mguu mmoja na kishikilia-kinga cha paji la uso haisemi tena muda maalum au hesabu ambayo inatofautiana na kiwango chako; vidokezo vyao vya uhuishaji sasa vinaelekeza kwenye wakati au hushikilia viwango vyako vilivyoainishwa.",
  "Plan change: Step-ups use a low aerobic step; Poliquin heel taps start on a slant board on the floor, with matching animations.": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Hatua-ups hutumia hatua ya chini ya aerobic; Mabomba ya kisigino cha Poliquin huanza kwenye ubao wa slant kwenye sakafu, na uhuishaji unaolingana.",
  "Plan change: Well trained includes all target cardio without extra walks; keeping the strength work makes sessions 72 to 93 minutes.": "Mabadiliko ya mpango: Uliofunzwa vizuri unajumuisha Cardio yote inayolengwa bila matembezi ya ziada; kuweka nguvu kazi hufanya vikao 72 hadi 93 dakika.",
  "Plan change: Your training level alone now sets the workouts. Each of the four levels (New to training, Returning, Active, Well trained) has its own sets, reps, intervals and Zone 2 minutes; nothing moves on by itself. Your weight, sex and age still scale the suggested weights.": "Panga mabadiliko: Kiwango chako cha mafunzo pekee sasa ndicho kinaweka mazoezi. Kila moja ya ngazi nne (Mpya kwa mafunzo, Kurudi, Hai, Iliyofunzwa vizuri) ina seti zake, reps, vipindi na Eneo la dakika 2; hakuna kinachoendelea chenyewe. Uzito wako, jinsia na umri bado hupima uzito uliopendekezwa.",
