  "Posture guide updated. His day: 90 min of cardio, strength, balance and stretching, HIIT twice a week, active weekends. Bone protocol: jumping in warm-ups 4–7×/week, power training 2×/week. 9 Apr: 10 squats every 45 min of sitting.": "Mwongozo wa mkao umesasishwa. Siku yake: Dakika 90 za Cardio, nguvu, usawa na kunyoosha, HIIT mara mbili kwa wiki, wikendi hai. Itifaki ya mifupa: kuruka katika joto-ups 4-7 × / wiki, mafunzo ya nguvu 2 × / wiki. 9 Apr: 10 kuchuchumaa kila dakika 45 ya kukaa.",
