  "Progress jump height and landing intensity only when knees and ankles feel completely comfortable the next morning.": "Maendeleo ya urefu wa kuruka na kiwango cha kutua tu wakati magoti na vifundo vya miguu huhisi vizuri kabisa asubuhi iliyofuata.",
  "Progress shows exact interval dates and applies them to all charts, tables and summary totals.": "Maendeleo yanaonyesha tarehe kamili za muda na inazitumia kwa chati, majedwali na jumla za muhtasari.",
