  "Pull bars close tightly on the hands with straight arms in hangs and leg raises; forearm planks put the elbows under the shoulders on a mat.": "Kuvuta baa karibu kukazwa juu ya mikono na mikono moja kwa moja katika hangs na kuinua mguu; mbao za forearm kuweka elbows chini ya mabega juu ya mkeka.",
