  "Set {set} of {sets}.": "Weka {set} ya {sets}.",
  "Set cards are narrower than the panel and keep the set name, field name and value on one line. Add set sits at the end of the last set row, and per-set timer icons are gone in guided mode.": "Kadi zilizowekwa ni nyembamba kuliko kidirisha na huhifadhi jina lililowekwa, jina la uwanja na thamani kwenye mstari mmoja. Ongeza seti za kukaa mwishoni mwa safu mlalo iliyowekwa mwisho, na aikoni za kipima saa kwa kila seti hazipo katika hali ya kuongozwa.",
  "Set rows put the set name, field name and value on one compact line, with narrow inputs. Extra sets scroll inside a capped box instead of stretching the panel.": "Weka safu mlalo weka jina lililowekwa, jina la uwanja na thamani kwenye mstari mmoja wa kuunganishwa, na ingizo finyu. Seti za ziada tembeza ndani ya kisanduku chenye kofia badala ya kunyoosha paneli.",
  "Set two of three. Ten repetitions, with a slow, controlled movement on the way down.": "Weka mbili kati ya tatu. Marudio kumi, na harakati ya polepole, iliyodhibitiwa kwenye njia ya chini.",
  "Set up your equipment": "Weka vifaa vyako",
  "sets": "seti",
  "Settings": "Mipangilio",
  "Settings → Animation style: a live preview of Zone 2, a card with a still of each style, and Try styles live, which opens Zone 2 with a numbered switcher at the top of the screen, like the theme switcher. Both switchers can be open at once.": "Mipangilio → Mtindo wa uhuishaji: onyesho la kukagua moja kwa moja la Zone 2, kadi iliyo na utulivu wa kila mtindo, na mitindo ya Jaribu moja kwa moja, ambayo hufungua Eneo la 2 kwa kibadilishaji chenye nambari juu ya skrini, kama kibadilisha mandhari. Swichi zote mbili zinaweza kufunguliwa mara moja.",
  "Settings → Animation style: pick which exercise the preview and the style cards show.": "Mipangilio → Mtindo wa uhuishaji: chagua zoezi la onyesho la kukagua na kadi za mtindo zionyeshe.",
  "Settings → Appearance now puts Light or dark first, then Try themes live, then the theme screenshots.": "Mipangilio → Mwonekano sasa huweka Mwangaza au giza kwanza, kisha Jaribu mandhari moja kwa moja, kisha picha za skrini za mandhari.",
  "Settings → Voice coach": "Mipangilio → Kocha ya sauti",
  "Settings links to the GitHub repository and the full changelog on GitHub.": "Mipangilio inaunganisha hazina ya GitHub na logi kamili ya mabadiliko kwenye GitHub.",
  "Settings refreshes the installed version when opened; the server no longer keeps an old version after an update.": "Mipangilio huonyesha upya toleo lililosakinishwa linapofunguliwa; seva haihifadhi tena toleo la zamani baada ya sasisho.",
  "Settings shows name, age, weight and height on one line, with the name field largest, and sex beside units.": "Mipangilio inaonyesha jina, umri, uzito na urefu kwenye mstari mmoja, na uga wa jina kuwa mkubwa zaidi, na jinsia kando ya vitengo.",
  "Settings shows the app version and opens the five latest release notes.": "Mipangilio huonyesha toleo la programu na kufungua madokezo matano ya toleo jipya zaidi.",
  "Settings shows the manual level picker first, with the level check collapsed below it.": "Mipangilio huonyesha kiteua kiwango kwa mikono kwanza, huku ukaguzi wa kiwango ukiwa chini yake.",
  "Settings stays responsive on open by loading animation previews only when they are near the screen.": "Mipangilio husalia kuitikia ikiwa imefunguliwa kwa kupakia onyesho la kukagua uhuishaji tu ikiwa karibu na skrini.",
  "Setup has a new Accessories step: what you need at home (dumbbells, pull-up bar, bands, mat, slant board, step or box, Nordic anchor), each shown in a 3D example exercise.": "Usanidi una hatua mpya ya Vifaa: unachohitaji nyumbani (dumbbells, upau wa kuvuta-juu, bendi, mkeka, ubao wa mshazari, hatua au kisanduku, nanga ya Nordic), kila moja ikionyeshwa katika zoezi la mfano wa 3D.",
  "Setup has a new Theme step right after Welcome.": "Usanidi una hatua mpya ya Mandhari mara baada ya Karibu.",
  "Setup now starts with the language picker, so the rest of setup is in your language.": "Usanidi sasa unaanza na kiteua lugha, ili usanidi uliosalia uwe katika lugha yako.",
  "Sex": "Ngono",
  "Sex (scales starting weights)": "Jinsia (mizani kuanzia uzito)",
  "Shared coaching refers to weights and heart-rate targets on screen, keeping personal profile values out of the audio.": "Mafunzo ya pamoja yanarejelea uzani na shabaha za mapigo ya moyo kwenye skrini, na kuzuia maadili ya wasifu wa kibinafsi kutoka kwa sauti.",
  "Shared recordings for all five voices, covering every level, add-ons, easier alternatives and timer choices.": "Rekodi zilizoshirikiwa za sauti zote tano, zinazojumuisha kila kiwango, programu jalizi, njia mbadala rahisi na chaguo za kipima muda.",
  "Shared voice builds reuse existing recordings and skip the speech model when nothing needs recording.": "Sauti inayoshirikiwa huunda tena rekodi zilizopo na kuruka muundo wa hotuba wakati hakuna kitu kinachohitaji kurekodiwa.",
  "Sharp pain, tingling, numbness or a joint that gives way: stop this movement and get it checked before training it again.": "Maumivu makali, kutetemeka, kufa ganzi au kiungo kinachoacha njia: acha harakati hii na uikague kabla ya kuifundisha tena.",
