  "Spend 2–4 minutes decompressing the spine and building elite grip strength. Includes passive hangs for disc hydration, active hangs for shoulder stability, and farmer's holds. Bryan's grip strength ranks in the top 5% for all ages.": "Tumia dakika 2-4 kupunguza uti wa mgongo na kujenga nguvu ya kukamata ya wasomi. Ni pamoja na hangs passiv kwa ajili ya diski hidrati, hangs hai kwa uthabiti mabega, na mkulima kushikilia. Nguvu za mshiko za Bryan ziko katika 5% ya juu kwa miaka yote.",
  "Spend 3–4 minutes stimulating bone mineral density through high-impact ground-reaction loading. Includes heel drops & stomp drills, pogo hops and snap-down landings from Bryan's bone health protocol.": "Tumia dakika 3-4 kuchochea msongamano wa madini ya mfupa kupitia upakiaji wenye athari ya juu ya mmenyuko wa ardhini. Inajumuisha matone ya kisigino na mazoezi ya kukanyaga, hops za pogo na kutua kwa haraka kutoka kwa itifaki ya afya ya mifupa ya Bryan.",
  "Spend 8–10 minutes after each session on tech neck and forward shoulders. Use Bryan's string cue, band pull-aparts, face pulls and external rotation, plus his two physical-therapist exercises twice a week. Chin tucks and a doorway stretch are included as extras.": "Tumia dakika 8-10 baada ya kila kipindi kwenye shingo ya kiufundi na mabega ya mbele. Tumia alama ya kamba ya Bryan, sehemu ya kuunganisha bendi, kuvuta uso na kuzungusha nje, pamoja na mazoezi yake mawili ya tiba ya mwili mara mbili kwa wiki. Vifunga vya kidevu na kunyoosha mlango vimejumuishwa kama nyongeza.",
