  "Start standing. Cross legs and lower to the floor, then stand back up. Subtract 1 point for each hand, forearm, knee, or side of leg that touches the floor.": "Anza kusimama. Kuvuka miguu na chini kwa sakafu, kisha kusimama nyuma juu. Toa pointi 1 kwa kila mkono, mkono, goti, au upande wa mguu unaogusa sakafu.",
