  "Start training": "Anza mafunzo",
  "Start with 1–2 sets. Use a chair or wall for support, or a smaller range of motion, while you learn the positions.": "Anza na seti 1-2. Tumia kiti au ukuta kwa usaidizi, au safu ndogo ya mwendo, unapojifunza nafasi.",
  "Start with a few minutes of easy movement, then dynamic exercises, as in Bryan’s official warm-up. Hops and balance come from his bone protocol and five exercise pillars.": "Anza na dakika chache za harakati rahisi, kisha mazoezi ya nguvu, kama katika kupasha moto rasmi kwa Bryan. Humle na mizani hutoka kwenye itifaki yake ya mfupa na nguzo tano za mazoezi.",
  "Start with a small range of motion and increase it each week.": "Anza na safu ndogo ya mwendo na uiongeze kila wiki.",
  "Start with feet lightly supported if needed. Alternate between relaxing into a passive hang (spine decompression) and engaging the active hang (shoulders pulled down).": "Anza kwa kutumia miguu kwa urahisi ikiwa inahitajika. Badala kati ya kustarehe ndani ya tungo tulivu (kupunguka kwa mgongo) na kushughulisha hutegemea (mabega yaliyovutwa chini).",
  "Start with supported exercises, 1–2 sets and light weights. There are no jumps.": "Anza na mazoezi yanayoungwa mkono, seti 1-2 na uzani mwepesi. Hakuna kurukaruka.",
  "Start with supported exercises, 1–2 sets and light weights. There are no jumps. Effort 4–5 out of 10: stop each set with 5 or more easy reps left.": "Anza na mazoezi yanayoungwa mkono, seti 1-2 na uzani mwepesi. Hakuna kurukaruka. Juhudi 4–5 kati ya 10: simamisha kila seti ukiwa umesalia na wawakilishi 5 au zaidi rahisi.",
