  "Step-ups roll onto the forefoot without sinking into the floor; side planks keep the elbow and foot planted as the hips move.": "Hatua-ups zinaendelea kwenye paji la uso bila kuzama kwenye sakafu; mbao za pembeni huweka kiwiko na mguu kupandwa huku nyonga zikisogea.",
  "Step-ups, high knees, jacks, mountain climbers, burpees without push-up": "Hatua-ups, magoti ya juu, jacks, wapanda mlima, burpees bila push-up",
  "Stick the landing": "Fimbo ya kutua",
  "Stick the landing for 1–2 s: hips back, knee over the toes.": "Shika kutua kwa sekunde 1-2: viuno nyuma, goti juu ya vidole.",
  "Stiffness": "Ugumu",
  "Stomp drills": "Mazoezi ya kukanyaga",
  "Stomp the whole foot firmly into the floor, knee soft": "Piga mguu mzima kwa nguvu ndani ya sakafu, goti laini",
