  "Stop at a strong hamstring stretch, around mid-shin.": "Simama kwa kunyoosha kamba kali, karibu na katikati ya shin.",
  "Stop the clock when the foot shifts, a hand leaves the hip or the raised foot touches down.": "Acha saa wakati mguu unapohama, mkono huacha kiboko au mguu ulioinuliwa unagusa chini.",
  "Stop timer": "Acha kipima muda",
