  "Strength C · Power, lunge, press + tendons": "Nguvu C · Nguvu, lunge, bonyeza + kano",
  "Strength days take the template’s basics (squat, push-up, row, swing, lunge, presses, step-up, carry, planks) and add his signature Knees-Over-Toes and high-rep posture work.": "Siku za nguvu huchukua misingi ya kiolezo (kuchuchumaa, kusukuma-juu, safu mlalo, bembea, kuruka, mibonyesho, kupanda juu, kubeba, mbao) na kuongeza saini yake ya Magoti-Juu ya Miguu na kazi ya mkao wa juu.",
  "Strength includes lunges, overhead and floor presses, step-ups, swings and carries alongside his signature exercises.": "Nguvu ni pamoja na lunges, mashinikizo ya juu na sakafu, hatua-ups, swings na kubeba pamoja na mazoezi yake sahihi.",
  "Strength Mon/Wed/Fri with progressive overload, short intervals Tue, Norwegian 4×4 Thu (start with 2–3 rounds, hard but controlled), easy outdoor or social activity Sat, recovery Sun. At least 150 min Zone 2 and 75 min hard cardio, about 10 of them near max.": "Nguvu Mon/Wed/Fri na upakiaji unaoendelea, vipindi vifupi Tue, Norwe 4×4 Thu (anza na raundi 2–3, ngumu lakini iliyodhibitiwa), shughuli rahisi za nje au kijamii Sat, ahueni Jua. Angalau dakika 150 Zone 2 na 75 min cardio kali, karibu 10 kati yao karibu na upeo.",
  "Strength Mon/Wed/Fri, short intervals Tue and Norwegian 4×4 Thu follow Bryan’s template. Saturday adds controlled vigorous work to the indoor Zone 2 session to meet his weekly totals.": "Nguvu Jumatatu/Jumatano/Ijumaa, vipindi vifupi Jumanne na Kinorwe 4×4 Thu hufuata kiolezo cha Bryan. Jumamosi anaongeza kazi kubwa inayodhibitiwa kwenye kipindi cha ndani cha Zone 2 ili kukidhi jumla yake ya kila wiki.",
