  "Synthwave: neon tubes on a scrolling magenta grid under a striped sunset, mirrored on a wet floor.": "Synthwave: mirija ya neon kwenye gridi ya magenta inayosogeza chini ya machweo ya jua yenye mistari, inayoakisiwa kwenye sakafu yenye unyevunyevu.",
