  "Tailscale HTTPS setup instructions for private access from other tailnet devices.": "Maagizo ya usanidi wa Tailscale HTTPS kwa ufikiaji wa kibinafsi kutoka kwa vifaa vingine vya tailnet.",
  "Take 3 slow breaths. Repeat every time you sit down at your desk.": "Chukua pumzi 3 polepole. Rudia kila wakati unapoketi kwenye dawati lako.",
  "Take a rest day. Keep up your posture habits or go for an easy walk. You can log activity and notes below.": "Pumzika siku. Endelea na tabia zako za mkao au nenda kwa matembezi rahisi. Unaweza kuweka kumbukumbu za shughuli na vidokezo hapa chini.",
  "Take a side photo in the same spot. Is your ear over your shoulder?": "Piga picha ya kando katika sehemu moja. Je, sikio lako liko juu ya bega lako?",
  "Take short steps, landing on the ball of your foot before lowering the heel.": "Chukua hatua fupi, ukitua kwenye mpira wa mguu wako kabla ya kupunguza kisigino.",
  "Taking it controlled today.": "Kuichukua kudhibitiwa leo.",
  "Tap the heel lightly": "Gonga kisigino kidogo",
  "Tap the heel lightly, then straighten the working knee to come up.": "Piga kisigino kidogo, kisha unyoosha goti la kufanya kazi ili kuja juu.",
  "Tap the opposite shoulder": "Gonga bega kinyume",
  "Tap to enable audio": "Gusa ili kuwezesha sauti",
