  "Three demonstration videos for every exercise: two technique videos and one short, focused clip. When Bryan has a video it still opens first and stays the default.": "Video tatu za maonyesho kwa kila zoezi: video mbili za mbinu na klipu moja fupi iliyolenga. Wakati Bryan ana video bado hufungua kwanza na kubaki chaguomsingi.",
  "Thu": "Alhamisi",
  "Thursday": "Alhamisi",
  "Thursday in Bryan’s newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026): 4 rounds of 4 min at 85–95% of max heart rate with 3 min at 60–70% between, at a hard, controlled pace below an all-out sprint, starting with 2–3 rounds if four is too much. Bryan’s own variant (X, Dec 2024) is 4 min all-out with 4 min rest.": "Alhamisi katika kiolezo kipya zaidi cha wiki cha Bryan (jarida la mazoezi, 4 Okt 2026): Mizunguko 4 ya dakika 4 kwa 85-95% ya kiwango cha juu cha mapigo ya moyo na dakika 3 kwa 60-70% kati ya, kwa kasi ngumu, iliyodhibitiwa chini ya mbio za kila kitu, kuanzia na raundi 2-3 ikiwa nne ni nyingi. Lahaja ya Bryan mwenyewe (X, Des 2024) ni ya dakika 4 yote na mapumziko ya dakika 4.",
