  "Today automatically shows the first exercise animation inline on phones and tablets in every theme.": "Leo huonyesha kiotomatiki uhuishaji wa zoezi la kwanza kwenye mstari kwenye simu na kompyuta kibao katika kila mandhari.",
  "Today groups Done, Something hurts? and Note into one compact action row; notes open underneath.": "Leo vikundi vimekamilika, kuna kitu kinaumiza? na Kumbuka katika safu moja ya kitendo cha kompakt; noti zilizofunguliwa chini.",
