  "Today now scrolls as one page across themes, without a separate scrollbar inside the exercise panel.": "Leo sasa inasonga kama ukurasa mmoja kwenye mada, bila upau wa kusogeza tofauti ndani ya kidirisha cha mazoezi.",
  "Today puts Swap session before Skip day and styles the session picker for each theme.": "Leo huweka kipindi cha Kubadilishana kabla ya siku ya Ruka na huweka mitindo ya kiteua kipindi kwa kila mada.",
  "Today shows a weekly-targets chip that links to the scoreboard, and Settings links to the level check.": "Leo inaonyesha chipu ya malengo ya kila wiki inayounganishwa kwenye ubao wa matokeo, na Mipangilio inaunganisha kwenye ukaguzi wa kiwango.",
  "Today uses the same inline timer instead of opening a separate timer window. The Timer button beside Minutes and intervals is a little larger.": "Leo hutumia kipima saa sawa cha ndani badala ya kufungua kidirisha tofauti cha kipima saa. Kitufe cha Kipima Muda kando ya Dakika na vipindi ni kubwa kidogo.",
  "Today, This week, the guided workout, Progress, the exercise pages and The plan show your level instead of a phase; The plan and each exercise compare all four levels.": "Leo, Wiki hii, mazoezi ya kuongozwa, Maendeleo, kurasa za mazoezi na Mpango unaonyesha kiwango chako badala ya awamu; Mpango na kila zoezi kulinganisha ngazi zote nne.",
  "Today: {move} move breaks · {squats} squat sets · {streak}-day streak": "Leo: Mapumziko ya kusonga ya {move} · Seti za squat za {squats} · Mfululizo wa siku wa {streak}",
