  "Today’s exercise panel follows the list, scrolls independently and returns to the animation when you select another exercise.": "Paneli ya mazoezi ya leo hufuata orodha, husogeza kivyake na kurudi kwenye uhuishaji unapochagua zoezi lingine.",
