  "Train anyway": "Treni hata hivyo",
  "Train strength on Monday, Wednesday and Friday, do short intervals on Tuesday and the Norwegian 4×4 on Thursday, then mixed cardio on Saturday. Rest on Sunday. Zone 2 and controlled vigorous blocks build toward Bryan Johnson's weekly cardio targets. His public protocol is adapted here for bodyweight, adjustable dumbbells, a pull-up bar and bands.": "Treni ya nguvu siku ya Jumatatu, Jumatano na Ijumaa, fanya vipindi vifupi Jumanne na Kinorwe 4×4 Alhamisi, kisha mchanganyiko wa Cardio Jumamosi. Pumzika Jumapili. Eneo la 2 na vizuizi vikali vinavyodhibitiwa vinajengwa kuelekea malengo ya kila wiki ya Bryan Johnson ya moyo. Itifaki yake ya umma imebadilishwa hapa kwa uzito wa mwili, dumbbells zinazoweza kubadilishwa, upau wa kuvuta-up na bendi.",
  "Trained": "Umefunzwa",
  "Training level": "Kiwango cha mafunzo",
  "Training levels": "Viwango vya mafunzo",
  "Training levels in pairs, a fitted weekly table and clearer heart-rate estimates.": "Viwango vya mafunzo kwa jozi, jedwali la kila wiki lililowekwa na makadirio ya wazi zaidi ya mapigo ya moyo.",
  "Training to dunk at 49": "Mafunzo kwa dunk saa 49",
