  "Training with Ben Patrick": "Mafunzo na Ben Patrick",
  "Translated voices keep polling while their cache is prepared, so the download no longer appears stuck at 0.": "Sauti zilizotafsiriwa zinaendelea kupiga kura wakati akiba yao inatayarishwa, kwa hivyo upakuaji hauonekani tena umekwama kwa 0.",
  "Translated workout doses set the same timers and defaults as English.": "Vipimo vya mazoezi vilivyotafsiriwa huweka vipima muda na chaguo-msingi sawa na Kiingereza.",
