  "Try styles live opens today's session, or the exercise in the preview on a phone or a rest day.": "Jaribu mitindo moja kwa moja hufungua kipindi cha leo, au zoezi la uhakiki kwenye simu au siku ya mapumziko.",
  "Try themes live": "Jaribu mandhari moja kwa moja",
  "Try themes live in Settings → Appearance: opens Today with a small switcher floating at the top of the screen, one letter per theme (A Original to G Course). Hover a letter to see its name, keep using any page while you compare, and close it with × (or Escape). It stays open across pages and reloads until you close it.": "Jaribu mandhari moja kwa moja katika Mipangilio → Mwonekano: itafunguliwa Leo kwa kibadilishaji kidogo kinachoelea juu ya skrini, herufi moja kwa kila mandhari (Kozi Asili hadi G). Elea herufi ili kuona jina lake, endelea kutumia ukurasa wowote unapolinganisha, na uifunge kwa × (au Escape). Husalia wazi katika kurasa zote na kupakiwa upya hadi uifunge.",
  "Tuck the pelvis and squeeze the back glute first.": "Piga pelvis na itapunguza glute ya nyuma kwanza.",
  "Tuck the pelvis, squeeze the back glute": "Piga pelvis, itapunguza glute nyuma",
  "Tuck your chin and roll down one vertebra at a time toward your toes.": "Inua kidevu chako na utembeze chini ya vertebra moja kwa wakati kuelekea vidole vyako.",
  "Tuck your chin, roll down slowly": "Weka kidevu chako, tembeza chini polepole",
  "Tue": "Jumanne",
  "Tuesday": "Jumanne",
  "Tuesday in Bryan’s newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026): 8 rounds of 20 s efforts with 40 s rest for beginners, then moderate cardio. Day 2 of his official protocol uses 20 s all-out with 20 s rest. These bursts are where most of your near-max minutes come from.": "Jumanne katika kiolezo kipya zaidi cha wiki cha Bryan (jarida la mazoezi, 4 Okt 2026): Mizunguko 8 ya juhudi za 20 na mapumziko ya 40 kwa wanaoanza, kisha Cardio ya wastani. Siku ya 2 ya itifaki yake rasmi hutumia 20 s all-out na 20 s mapumziko. Miripuko hii ndipo dakika zako nyingi zinazokaribia upeo wa juu hutoka.",
  "Tuesday, October 13": "Jumanne, Oktoba 13",
  "Tuesday, October 20": "Jumanne, Oktoba 20",
  "Tuesday, October 27": "Jumanne, Oktoba 27",
  "Tuesday, October 6": "Jumanne, Oktoba 6",
  "Tuesday: 4 brisk 20 s bursts. Thursday: 2 rounds of 2 min brisk, well below all-out.": "Jumanne: 4 haraka 20 s kupasuka. Alhamisi: Raundi 2 za haraka za dakika 2, chini kabisa.",
  "Tuesday: 8 × 20 s hard. Thursday: 3 rounds of 4 min, then 4.": "Jumanne: 8 × 20 s ngumu. Alhamisi: raundi 3 za dakika 4, kisha 4.",
  "Tuesday: brisk 20 s bursts with long recoveries. Thursday: 2 controlled rounds of 3 min, building to 3 rounds.": "Jumanne: brisk 20 s kupasuka na kupona kwa muda mrefu. Alhamisi: raundi 2 zilizodhibitiwa za dakika 3, kujenga hadi raundi 3.",
  "Tuesday: Intervals 1 · 20-second bursts + Zone 2 + back & core": "Jumanne: Vipindi 1 · Mipasuko ya sekunde 20 + Eneo la 2 + nyuma na msingi",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at {hr:85-95}.": "Jumanne: vitalu viwili vya 8 × 20 s viko nje. Alhamisi: Kinorwe 4×4 kamili katika {hr:85-95}.",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at 159–178 bpm.": "Jumanne: vitalu viwili vya 8 × 20 s viko nje. Alhamisi: Kinorwe 4×4 kamili kwa 159–178 bpm.",
  "Turkish woman · warm": "Mwanamke wa Kituruki · joto",
  "Turn coaching off": "Zima kufundisha",
  "Turn coaching on": "Washa kufundisha",
  "Turn coaching on once to save the included recordings for playback. No audio is unpacked before that.": "Washa kufundisha mara moja ili kuhifadhi rekodi zilizojumuishwa kwa kucheza tena. Hakuna sauti iliyopakuliwa kabla ya hapo.",
  "Turn each add-on on or off, choose how often it repeats (daily or every 2–7 days), and decide whether it appears on Sunday. A repeat counts from the day you set it; Sunday only changes whether the add-on appears that day.": "Washa au uzime kila kiongezi, chagua ni mara ngapi kinajirudia (kila siku au kila baada ya siku 2-7), na uamue iwapo kitaonekana Jumapili. Kurudia kuhesabu kutoka siku uliyoiweka; Jumapili hubadilika tu ikiwa programu-jalizi itaonekana siku hiyo.",
  "Turn from your hips and pivot your back foot. Let the turn drive the movement through your arms.": "Geuka kutoka kwenye viuno vyako na uelekeze mguu wako wa nyuma. Acha zamu iendeshe harakati kupitia mikono yako.",
  "Turn your chest toward the front knee": "Geuza kifua chako kuelekea goti la mbele",
  "Turning coaching on copies the included audio instead of generating a voice pack locally; speech can play while the rest copies.": "Kuwasha mafunzo kwa nakala za sauti iliyojumuishwa badala ya kutengeneza kifurushi cha sauti ndani ya nchi; hotuba inaweza kucheza wakati wengine nakala.",
  "Turning timer beeps off no longer silences voice coaching.": "Kuzima kipima saa hakunyamazishi tena ufundishaji wa sauti.",
