  "Wall-supported drills keep the supporting hand planted the whole time (leg swings and standing hip CARs), and hip CARs circle both directions as the steps describe.": "Uchimbaji unaoungwa mkono na ukuta huweka mkono wa kuunga mkono uliopandwa wakati wote (bembea za mguu na CAR za kiuno zilizosimama), na CAR za kiuno huzunguka pande zote mbili kama hatua zinavyoelezea.",
  "Wall-supported movements keep the palms flat, and seated calf raises sit above the chair seat.": "Harakati zinazoungwa mkono na ukuta huweka viganja tambarare, na nyanda za ndama aliyeketi hukaa juu ya kiti cha kiti.",
  "Wall-supported standing hip CARs": "CAR za kiuno zilizosimama zinazoungwa mkono na ukuta",
  "Warm up first. Use continuous low-step step-ups, fast marching, high knees or step jacks, changing the move before local muscle fatigue spoils your form.": "Pasha joto kwanza. Tumia hatua zinazoendelea za hatua ya chini, kuandamana kwa haraka, magoti ya juu au vifungo vya hatua, kubadilisha hatua kabla ya uchovu wa misuli ya ndani kuharibu fomu yako.",
