  "Well trained contrast: 20–30 s after each set, do 3 max countermovement jumps, the way Bryan pairs his heavy pulls with jumps.": "Utofautishaji uliofunzwa vyema: Sekunde 20–30 baada ya kila seti, fanya miruko 3 ya juu zaidi ya kukabiliana na harakati, jinsi Bryan anavyooanisha mvuto wake mzito na miruko.",
  "Well trained is the top level. After illness, injury or a long break, the plan says step down for a while.": "Kufunzwa vizuri ni kiwango cha juu. Baada ya ugonjwa, kuumia au mapumziko ya muda mrefu, mpango unasema kuondoka kwa muda.",
